              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵaŵisile mwakupacisya, kacisogosi kamo kabelo kamo, kacisogosi kamo kabelo kamo, kusyungulila mlutoto losope lwa mwiŵanda mwa mkanjo, uŵawalaga ŵakutaga mbopesi pakukamula masengo gawo gakutaga mbopesi, mpela mwele AMBUJE ŵamlamulile Mose.",
          "type": "text",
