          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵapanganyisye soni lamba jwakutaŵila, jwa nguwo ja bafuta jwa kutililika mnope soni jwamluce cenene, ni litonji lya buluwu, lya papo ni lyecejewu, ŵa msalalisye lambajo ni yakupetapeta, mpela mwele AMBUJE ŵamlamulile Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
